@startuml US_3_2_4_C1
title US 3.2.4 - Cenário RBAC end-to-end

actor User
participant SPA as "SPA (AuthGuard)"
participant API as "TodoApi + Middleware"
database DB as "PortContext"

User -> SPA: acede /admin/users
SPA -> API: GET /admin/users (cookie)
API -> DB: validar AppUser ativo + roles
DB --> API: roles
API -> API: [Authorize] verifica role
API --> SPA: 200 se autorizado, 403 se não
SPA -> User: render ou Access Denied

@enduml
